{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 206,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.5050048828125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Several of the studies in the review addressed treatment costs. However, cost estimates were found to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983838081359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.6261596679688,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "vary widely and no concrete recommendations could be made on that basis. Resource requirements",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998600006103516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.169677734375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "are likely to vary because TB treatment programmes are highly variable and costs vary across different",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969306945800781,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4277954101562,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "countries. The GDG raised several issues for TB programmes to consider. Although hospitalization",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.6093139648438,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "is generally thought to be more expensive than outpatient care, the costs of good outpatient",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4201049804688,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "programmes can also be significant. Additionally, outpatient costs may vary significantly according",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4212036132812,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "to the services provided. One cost-saving measure to consider in decentralized care is that patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.4354858398438,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "may be able to receive treatment faster. The financial benefits of decentralized care would include",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.4508666992188,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "finding patients before they become very ill and require more medical care, while treating people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        411.0731201171875,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "before TB can be transmitted to contacts would be a public health benefit.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.3760375976562,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "If a patient is living with a person from a high-risk group (i.e. HIV-positive or a young child), there",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        524.427001953125,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "may be complications in sending the patient home for treatment. However, the risk posed to high-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.6305541992188,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "risk groups varies significantly, depending on whether the TB programme gives preventive treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998600006103516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        451.7994689941406,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "to high-risk persons. Studies involving preventive therapy for MDR-TB are ongoing.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.4834594726562,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "An additional implementation concern is that in some places it may be illegal to treat MDR-TB patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966048240661621,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.6129760742188,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "in a decentralized setting, especially when the treatment involves injections. Such legal concerns need",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978328704833984,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        147.45909118652344,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "to be addressed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.0298156738281,
        470.3087463378906,
        348.8248291015625
      ],
      "text": "3. Models of care for children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.8299255371094,
        358.1099853515625,
        371.62493896484375
      ],
      "text": "exposed to TB or with TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.16510009765625,
        259.95892333984375,
        404.04510498046875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations 3.1–3.2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        415.7505187988281,
        200.64849853515625,
        430.1054992675781
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        437.3651123046875,
        497.5594787597656,
        451.9181213378906
      ],
      "text": "3.1 In TB high-burden settings, decentralized models of care may be used to deliver TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.56929779052734,
        449.47509765625,
        488.0830383300781,
        463.9181213378906
      ],
      "text": "services to children and adolescents with signs and symptoms of TB and/or those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.56929779052734,
        461.47509765625,
        183.59632873535156,
        475.9181213378906
      ],
      "text": "exposed to TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.56929779052734,
        476.4510192871094,
        389.121337890625,
        492.1150207519531
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        499.2317199707031,
        518.5595703125,
        513.7847290039062
      ],
      "text": "3.2 Family-centred, integrated models of care to deliver TB services may be used in children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.56929779052734,
        511.3416748046875,
        520.023681640625,
        525.78466796875
      ],
      "text": "and adolescents with signs and symptoms of TB and/or those exposed to TB, in addition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.56929779052734,
        523.3416748046875,
        238.74374389648438,
        537.78466796875
      ],
      "text": "to standard models of care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.56929779052734,
        538.317626953125,
        389.121337890625,
        553.9816284179688
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.7140502929688,
        119.47928619384766,
        586.5661010742188
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.7739868164062,
        527.4116821289062,
        608.2169799804688
      ],
      "text": "1.\t These recommendations relate to TB services along the full range of care with a focus on case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        606.9739990234375,
        228.07534790039062,
        621.4169921875
      ],
      "text": "detection and provision of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.426025390625,
        527.1441650390625,
        638.8690185546875
      ],
      "text": "2.\t  The recommendations apply to children and adolescents with signs and symptoms of TB in terms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        637.6259765625,
        527.4392700195312,
        652.0689697265625
      ],
      "text": "of the impact on case detection. They also concern children and adolescents who are exposed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        650.825927734375,
        527.4459228515625,
        665.2689208984375
      ],
      "text": "to TB (i.e. TB contacts), and who are eligible for TPT, in terms of the impact on provision of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        664.02587890625,
        527.4315185546875,
        678.4688720703125
      ],
      "text": "Children and adolescents with signs and symptoms who need evaluation for TB disease may also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        677.2258911132812,
        527.3810424804688,
        691.6688842773438
      ],
      "text": "have a history of exposure to TB (i.e. TB contacts). Children and adolescents who are TB contacts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        690.426025390625,
        458.0766296386719,
        704.8690185546875
      ],
      "text": "and who do not have signs and symptoms should be evaluated for TPT eligibility.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.8779296875,
        527.2246704101562,
        722.3209228515625
      ],
      "text": "3.\t The recommendation on decentralized services refers to enhancing child and adolescent TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        721.077880859375,
        527.4174194335938,
        735.5208740234375
      ],
      "text": "services at peripheral levels of the health system where they are closer to the community, and not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993497848510742,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        734.2778930664062,
        465.7425537109375,
        748.7208862304688
      ],
      "text": "to replacing specialized paediatric TB services at higher levels of the health system.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "192 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
